# Google Programmable Search (Custom Search JSON API), 100 free queries/day.
# 1. API key:          https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
# 2. Search engine ID: https://programmablesearchengine.google.com
#                      create one, then turn on "Search the entire web"
# Copy this file to .env. Without these the app returns zero results and falls
# back to pure inference, which still works (and is arguably the better demo).
GOOGLE_API_KEY=
GOOGLE_CX=
